WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
The opening crouching lights connect at close range.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.450
Standing light punch is cancelled into Drive Rush.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.050
A standing jab connects from the Rush.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.350
Back heavy punch links after the Rush jab.

5
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:02.650
Chun-Li enters Serenity Stream after the heavy punch.

6
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.450
Stance light kick connects.

7
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.100
Medium Spinning Bird Kick finishes the stance conversion.

8
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:05.400
Jamie recovers after the medium-SBK finish.
